Column name: MC Type: VARIANT Description: Allele frequency in the SAS populations calculated from AC and AN, in the range (0,1)
Column name: CIEND Type: VARIANT Description: Allele frequency in the EAS populations calculated from AC and AN, in the range (0,1)
Column name: SVLEN Type: VARIANT Description: Confidence interval around POS for imprecise variants
