Column name: Total_Exome_Sequence Type: FLOAT Description: The total amount of exome sequence available
Column name: VerifyBam_LC_Affy_Free Type: FLOAT Description: Value from UMich's VerifyBamID BAM QC program http://genome.sph.umich.edu/wiki/VerifyBamID.  The Free measures use a statistical model based on the haplotypes discovered by the chip. The Chip measure considers the genotypes available for that individual from that chip. We use greater than 3% as a cut off for our our low coverage samples and greater than 3.5% for our exome samples.
Column name: VerifyBam_LC_Omni_Free Type: FLOAT Description: Value from UMich's VerifyBamID BAM QC program http://genome.sph.umich.edu/wiki/VerifyBamID.  The Free measures use a statistical model based on the haplotypes discovered by the chip. The Chip measure considers the genotypes available for that individual from that chip. We use greater than 3% as a cut off for our our low coverage samples and greater than 3.5% for our exome samples.
Column name: Has_Omni_Genotypes Type: BOOLEAN Description: Omni Genotypes in ftp://ftp.1000genomes.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/ftp/technical/working/20120131_omni_genotypes_and_intensities/Omni25_genotypes_2141_samples.b37.vcf.gz   
Column name: Has_phase1_chrMT_SNPs Type: BOOLEAN Description: The sample is genotyped in the phase1 chrMT snps
Column name: Phase1_E_Platform Type: TEXT Description: phase1 exome sequencing platforms
Column name: LC_Pilot_Centers Type: TEXT Description: low coverage pilot sequencing centers
Column name: Super_Population_Description Type: TEXT Description: From ftp://ftp.1000genomes.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/ftp/20131219.superpopulations.tsv
Column name: Avuncular Type: TEXT Description: sample ids for any avuncular relationships
Column name: E_Indel_Ratio Type: FLOAT Description: Both Indel ratios are the ratio of insertions to deletions found in that sample using a quick test (based on samtools). If the ratio is higher than 5 the sample is withdrawn.
Column name: Unexpected_Parent_Child Type: TEXT Description: sample id for unexpected parent child relationships
Column name: E_Passed_QC Type: BOOLEAN Description: These are binary flags showing if the sample passed QC, All samples which have passed QC have bam files. Only samples which have both exome and low coverage data are found under ftp/data and listed in the standard alignment index. The small number of other samples are found in ftp://ftp.1000genomes.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/ftp/technical/phase3_EX_or_LC_only_alignment/
Column name: Has_Phase1_chrY_SNPS Type: BOOLEAN Description: The sample is genotyped in the chrY phase1 snp set
Column name: Family_ID Type: TEXT Description: Family ID
Column name: EBV_Coverage Type: FLOAT Description: This was calculated by looking at the alignment of the data to NC_007605 in the low coverage bam files and using that to calculate coverage   
Column name: In_Phase1_Integrated_Variant_Set Type: BOOLEAN Description: The sample is genotyped in the phase1 integrated call set on autosomes and chrX
Column name: LC_Pilot_Platforms Type: TEXT Description: low coverage pilot sequencing platforms 
Column name: Main_project_LC_platform Type: TEXT Description: low coverage sequencing platform for final sequencing round
Column name: VerifyBam_LC_Affy_Chip Type: FLOAT Description: Value from UMich's VerifyBamID BAM QC program http://genome.sph.umich.edu/wiki/VerifyBamID.  The Free measures use a statistical model based on the haplotypes discovered by the chip. The Chip measure considers the genotypes available for that individual from that chip. We use greater than 3% as a cut off for our our low coverage samples and greater than 3.5% for our exome samples.
Column name: Has_Sequence_from_Blood_in_Index Type: BOOLEAN Description: In the later stages of the project some populations has multiple study ids, one to indicate sequencing from blood. This data for each sample has not been treated independently in the alignment process but when there is both LCL and Blood sourced data they are both together in single bams
Column name: Phase1_LC_Centers Type: TEXT Description: phase1 low coverage sequencing centers
